滿滿的醬料，與有彈性的粗麵，ㄧ口一口的混合入肚，還真有味。\n其實台灣有很多麵，賣的也是「醬汁」，像乾拌麵、重慶小麵、四川燃麵，都是取決於老闆調味的醬料，何不考慮日人這種「分離式」擺盤，價值感立即提升。\n至於麵碗裡那兩片舒肥雞及ㄧ片叉燒肉，不能少，但沒味！也許是要也放入醬汁碗沾沾，但台灣人講就的是肉要入味！\n整體上是ㄧ頓滿意的午餐，服務人員親切的講解，並擔心麵硬了不易入口，還再微波加熱，感恩！",null,[0,158]]]],[],[null,null,6813,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWVloxOVBXVU15UmxwTmVuQk5TRWhNZVdWVE5VRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x9122c0fa750e79ea!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjVVZ19PWUMyRlpNenBNSEhMeWVTNUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWVloxOVBXVU15UmxwTmVuQk5TRWhNZVdWVE5VRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWVloxOVBXVU15UmxwTmVuQk5TRWhNZVdWVE5VRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWVloxOVBXVU15UmxwTmVuQk5TRWhNZVdWVE5VRRILMGR1WHp5Y1ZxUFIaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qVlZaMTlQV1VNeVJscE5lbkJOU0VoTWVXVlROVUUSCzBkdVh6eWNWcVBSIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR6nkOdfrAIpEqCzBkdVh6eWNWcVBS\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQoykIkAEoIw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiB0buJ8dSWAxVn9hYFHeryANUQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQ0pMFCE0oAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0d2VXZERVR3hYTldkbVMyaFBNbEZNVG0wNE9YYxAB",["0x0:0x9122c0fa750e79ea",null,1761381688391834,1761381688391834,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115532238436678205546/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["周綺綺","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKEoR94RoGFSVW1IVdLF_etTO2c1Y8KBvjDfotgkUNYqPoN_g\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115532238436678205546?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"115532238436678205546",null,357,5140,null,[1,8,1],5,["在地嚮導 · 357 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQpr8GCJIBKAA"]]]],null,"10 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[3],null,[["CIABIhChCVz9xEAlmUqz79D62wuj",["CIABIhChCVz9xEAlmUqz79D62wuj",10,12,null,null,null,["https://