,"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQ3YcHCLsBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQ3IcHCLoBKBY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["同樣是沾麵，這家店的味道和其他分店相比確實有差異。這邊的沾麵湯頭魚腥味稍微明顯一些🤢，而且湯汁溫度偏溫，加上麵條後很快就變冷了。不過麵條口感相當Q彈、非常出色，但如果湯汁能熱一些會更理想。現在這樣搭配，微腥的湯頭讓口感稍顯油膩，吃多了還有些反胃。以前在中山店用餐時都會有加熱沾汁的服務，這邊好像就沒有😅\n\n至於胡麻龍鬚菜，份量雖然少，但清爽可口，整體不錯。A11限定的蝦湯拉麵湯頭非常好喝，唯一的缺點是湯量偏少，感覺一碗只裝了六到七分滿，可能是因為湯頭好喝，所以特別覺得不夠過癮。\n\n結帳後可以兌換冰淇淋券的規定並沒有清楚說明，對於第一次來用餐的客人來說可能完全不了解這項資訊。我原本以為這裡是百貨公司的分店，才會沒有這樣的優惠活動。但實際情況是，店家大力推廣留下5星好評即可獲得小菜的活動，可是真實服務跟湯品的品質差異真的讓我無法昧著良心留下5🌟",null,[0,151]]]],[],[null,null,17081,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0d2VXZERVR3hYTldkbVMyaFBNbEZNVG0wNE9YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x9122c0fa750e79ea!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk4weWdDUGxXNWdmS2hPMlFMTm04OXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0d2VXZERVR3hYTldkbVMyaFBNbEZNVG0wNE9YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0d2VXZERVR3hYTldkbVMyaFBNbEZNVG0wNE9YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0d2VXZERVR3hYTldkbVMyaFBNbEZNVG0wNE9YYxILMGN6N29zTUxpY3QaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rNHdlV2REVUd4WE5XZG1TMmhQTWxGTVRtMDRPWGMSCzBjejdvc01MaWN0IhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR6nkOdfrAIpEqCzBjejdvc01MaWN0\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQoykIvAEoFw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiB0buJ8dSWAxVn9hYFHeryANUQ0pMFCEYoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjfpbOJ8dSWAxX-dvUHHdkSK4oQ0pMFCJEBKAE"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdU1rWkxUMHg1Y1RRM1pWUkVNbkJvVVZKQ1pGRRAB",["0x0:0x9122c0fa750e79ea",null,1781423195995061,1781423195995061,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108590285005716819307/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Ming Chuan Yang","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpWy03KtG2VlPG9LN6olo8sjdqNsEANRCfD8I2Rgh1n4YdYqn-\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https:/